<title>JAPAN: Fukuda Denshi - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fukuda Denshi - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 21.78		vs	   17.64</p>
<p> Operating	    3.14		vs	    2.14</p>
<p> Current		3.21		vs	    2.47</p>
<p> Net		    1.63		vs	    1.21</p>
<p> EPS		   83.78 yen	  vs	   62.17 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     19 million	  vs	  19 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.00 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fukuda Denshi Co Ltd is a medical electronics equipment maker  and is a leader in electrocardiographs.</p>
